    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nDNG are proud to present 15A Walkinstown Drive to the market, a superb detached two-bedroom home offering bright, spacious and beautifully presented accommodation throughout. Presented in turnkey condition, the property benefits from a contemporary open-plan layout and is ideally suited to first-time buyers, downsizers or those seeking a low-maintenance home in a mature and convenient residential location.\n\nThe ground-floor accommodation is centred around an impressive open-plan living and dining area, creating a bright and versatile space ideal for both everyday living and entertaining. The kitchen is positioned just off the main living area and offers excellent countertop and storage space, while the entrance hall and staircase complete the ground floor.\n\nUpstairs, the accommodation comprises two well-proportioned bedrooms. The particularly generous principal bedroom extends to approximately 5.43m x 2.91m, while the second bedroom measures approximately 2.23m x 3.83m. A spacious bathroom and landing complete the first-floor accommodation.\n\nNo. 15A combines the independence and privacy of a detached property with a modern, open-plan interior and turnkey presentation. Its efficient layout makes excellent use of the available space, resulting in a comfortable and highly practical home ready for its new owners to simply move in and enjoy.\n\n15A Walkinstown Drive enjoys a highly convenient setting in the heart of Walkinstown, Dublin 12, a mature and well-established residential neighbourhood with an excellent range of amenities close at hand.\n\nThe property is within easy reach of local shops and services, with Ashleaf Shopping Centre, SuperValu Walkinstown and Lidl all nearby. Recreational amenities include Walkinstown Avenue Park, while a number of primary and secondary schools are within walking distance, including Assumption Junior National School Walkinstown and Drimnagh Castle Secondary School.\n\nTransport links are another major advantage, with numerous bus services operating in the surrounding area and the Luas Red Line at Kylemore approximately 1km away. The location also provides convenient access to the N7, N81 and M50 road networks, making the city centre and wider Dublin easily accessible."
      },
